  "scope": "Complete operation-level ledger for the 23 Amazon SQS operations listed by the AWS-owned Smithy model and AWS API Reference. This Tier-3 native connector executes fixed SQS Query API Action values only; there is no arbitrary AWS action, raw path, raw body, generic HTTP, shell, or passthrough escape hatch. ReceiveMessage remains the bounded messages stream; six read operations are typed operation direct reads; sixteen write/admin/destructive operations are typed reverse ETL actions with closed schemas, redaction, and plan -> preview -> explicit approval -> execute.",
